{"id":"00266","root":"uni00266_1","name":{"ja":"蓮魔　零子","en":"Hasuma Reiko"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"蓮魔　零子","en":"Hasuma Reiko"},"aliases":["Hasuba Reiko"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-11-14","limited":false,"characterId":196,"profile":{"ja":"現場で戦う傍ら、五車学園で教官を務める対魔忍。『物体を透視する』という忍法を持ち、隠れた相手の位置や体勢を見抜いて得物の鞭で叩きのめす。その苛烈な戦いぶりは、対魔忍内部はもちろん、他組織にまで名前が知れ渡るほど。学園での指導においてもその姿勢は変わらず、透視の力で学生の悪さを見抜き、厳しく指導するため、一部の生徒達からは非常に恐れられている。ただ、厳しい指導は生徒達への愛情故で、理不尽に生徒を責めたり、必要以上に叱責したりはしない。本人も幼い頃から両親に厳しくしつけられてきたが、父親が任務中に仲間のミスが原因で死亡した。そのため他人の妥協や甘えには厳しく、またそれ以上に自分自身を厳しく律している。その公平さと、常に堂々と振る舞う姿には憧れる生徒も多く、バレンタインには女生徒たちから沢山のチョコを渡されるほど。彼女は一応受け取るが「学生であり対魔忍であるお前達の本分を忘れない様に」と釘を刺す事も忘れない。","en":"Hasuma Reiko serves as a combat-field Taimanin while also teaching at Gosha Academy. She possesses a ninjutsu that \"sees through objects,\" allowing her to pinpoint hidden opponents' positions and stances before striking them down with her weapon's whip. Her fierce fighting style has become legendary not only within the Taimanin ranks but also across other organizations. In the academy she maintains the same approach, using her sight-through power to detect students' misbehavior and discipline them harshly, earning her great fear among some pupils. Her strictness stems from love for her students; she never berates them irrationally or scolds them beyond what is necessary. Raised under a strict upbringing, she lost her father when a teammate's mistake cost his life during a mission, making her intolerant of others' compromises or laziness and even stricter with herself. Her fairness and dignified bearing inspire many students, and on Valentine's Day she receives abundant chocolates from the female students. She accepts them politely, but always reminds them, \"Don't forget your duties as students and Taimanin.\""},"illustrator":"TANA","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00266_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[7